[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900100_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900100_02_0010","text":"捡落叶进展得不错嘛！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900100_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900100_02_0020","text":"夏叶姐！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900100_02_0030","text":"是的！\n收集了好多！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900100_02_0040","text":"落叶要是有很多的话\n就能烤红薯了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900100_02_0050","text":"所以，必须多收集一些……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900100_02_0060","text":"……原来如此\n要是这样的话，我也得加把劲才行呢！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900100_02_0070","text":"果穗！我们来比赛吧！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900100_02_0080","text":"比赛……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900100_02_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900100_02_0090","text":"没错！看谁能收集到更多的落叶……\n从现在开始，到集合时间为止来比赛！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900100_02_0100","text":"────好的！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900100_02_0101","text":"Motion"}]
